    "note": "Plate 40*30*10 = 12000; through holes r2 at x = 8 and 32 (the copy at 20 left out) remove 2 * 40 pi; the round r2 along the front top edge (40 long) removes 40 * 4 * (1 - pi/4). Leaving a copy out rebuilds the pattern as SciForge's feature; the fillet made on the pattern's edge must stay on that edge."
